    {
      "number": "1012",
      "text": "1012．解方程：\na) $(x+7)^2+(x-24)^2=(x-25)^2$；\nb) $(x+24)^2+(x-10)^2=(x+26)^2$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "1013",
      "text": "1013．解方程组：\na) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=(x+4)^2+(y-8)^2,\\\\x+y=35.\\end{cases}$\nb) $\\begin{cases}(x-6)^2+y^2=(y+2)^2+(x-10)^2,\\\\x+2y=46.\\end{cases}$",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "1014",
      "text": "1014*．变量取哪些值时，下列等式成立？（如果有这样的值，就都指出来）\na) $(x+2)^2=x^2+2^2$；\nb) $(x-2)^2=x^2-2^2$；\nc) $(x+5)^2=x+5$；\nd) $(5x+2)^2=(3x+2)^2$；\ne) $(5x+2)^2=5x^2+2^2$；\nf) $(5x-20)^2=(5x-20)\\cdot2$；\ng) $\\frac{(x-10)^2}{(10-x)^2}=1$；\nh) $\\frac{(x-10)^3}{(10-x)^3}=1$．",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
